<title>HONG KONG: RJP Elec interim net returns to black.</title>
<headline>RJP Elec interim net returns to black.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  0.08 gain   vs  3.84 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 3.66 gain   vs  30.00 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   0.40 profit vs  27.91 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    115.04	vs  165.17</p>
<p>    Company name		RJP Electronics Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - RJP makes consumer electronics products.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year-end to June 30 from March 31. The comparative figures are for the six-month period ended September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
